                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5daaf29-0ccd-3508-bd02-8345fba72e2d",
                                        "entry_id": "77859526-55ce-34a5-8746-f3425869edfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To go out the window; become ruined; become useless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9adec1fc-8855-419c-8eb5-f7d54eabbddb",
                                                "sense_id": "b5daaf29-0ccd-3508-bd02-8345fba72e2d",
                                                "text": "Well, that plan has gone to hell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9074cffb-3b86-4518-a9cf-a8903ca04049",
                                                "sense_id": "b5daaf29-0ccd-3508-bd02-8345fba72e2d",
                                                "text": "In my opinion, they want us to lose. If we lose Georgia, we lose the whole thing and our country goes to hell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e4448fd-cdff-4eab-8397-9fd78f16d7bd",
                                                "sense_id": "b5daaf29-0ccd-3508-bd02-8345fba72e2d",
                                                "text": "I'm really good at this stuff. Your countries are going to hell. In America, we've taken bold action to swiftly shut down uncontrolled migration. Once we started detaining and deporting everyone who crossed the border and removing illegal aliens from the United States, they simply stopped coming."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                        "entry_id": "77859526-55ce-34a5-8746-f3425869edfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of anger and contempt directed at someone, especially after that individual has committed a serious crime or transgression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5ae02f6-b608-44ed-ad25-7d4e6f7b0584",
                                                "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                                "text": "Why did Nancy do that to Jake? She can go to hell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93b3e55f-6623-47de-8609-5ae21a3e16bd",
                                                "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                                "text": "You want me to voluntarily work the weekend without pay? Go to hell!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a7fb2eb-2335-4862-9b94-38c56de86ee2",
                                                "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                                "text": "Let Fortune goe to hell for it, not I."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97a55b8a-6607-42d5-8894-74a06515f026",
                                                "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                                "text": "I shook my head and held up my rifle. \"You'll have to go aloft to do it, and the first man that gets into the shrouds will get this.\"\n\"Then she can go to hell for all we care,\" he said, with emphatic conclusiveness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4be785d7-27fc-4a3f-b8ec-8c306dd4c202",
                                                "sense_id": "a63f55de-d0c5-3e8f-867c-921f7bde3e03",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, go to hell!\" said Silas, and kicked open his own unlatched door."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
