                                                "sense_id": "9edf2616-826e-346c-b1fa-89761e9241ed",
                                                "text": "If you've come to fight, get outta here\n You ain't no better than the bouncers\n We ain't trying to be police\n When you ape the cops it ain't anarchy\n Nazi punks\n Nazi punks\n Nazi punks, fuck off!"
                                            },
